{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“两难”承接前段对行动与代价的反复权衡，“曾让自己满足的安宁”也有 S06-6 的依据；没有把珠子中的回望地点写成真实场景。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“柔软留不久”承接眼前处境未变的事实，“再待一会儿”和“预感快要失去”表达的是对短暂安宁的留恋与不舍，没有新增具体事件，也没有把喘息写成明确的生理动作。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-6\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-1\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S06-6 已说明那份安宁曾带来真实满足、使他舍不得离开，这份留恋足以解释他在两难中重新向它敞开心。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S08-2\",\n      \"label\": \"成立\",\n      \"why\": \"S07-1 已说明他虽然重新感到亲近，眼前处境却没有改变，因此有理由知道这份柔软无法长久维持。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"两条线呈现了从两难中重新向安宁敞开心，到明知安宁短暂仍想停留、同时预感失去的心理过程，不看珠子也能理解。\"\n  ,\n  \"lost\": [],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8c799c29-bd7c-4ff3-ba5e-dc8f730b401b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T062328022529Z", "elapsed_seconds": 289.375, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T06:28:17.412060+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "7ce99987c4f5e7f71dea74175c7b43067b49f24714f637e1f3e494eac128138b", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "